{"code":"145210","name":"다이나믹디자인","market":"KOSPI","sector_name":"자동차부품","sector_desc":"완성차에 들어가는 부품 제조. 완성차 생산량과 전동화(EV) 전환 속도, 환율의 영향을 받습니다.","desc":"동사는 2015년 유가증권시장에 상장한 타이어 금형 전문 제조 기업임. 타이어 금형 및 3D 신터링 사이프 사업을 운영하며, 금호타이어, 넥센타이어 등 국내 3사와 브릿지스톤, 피렐리 등 글로벌 Top-tier 업체를 주요 고객사로 확보하고 있음. 동사는 국내 최초 분절주형 제조법 개발로 품질 향상 및 대량 생산 체계를 구축하고 3D 프린터 개발을 통한 신사업 확장을 추진하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-23","n_days":300,"close":2240.0,"open":2240.0,"high":2240.0,"low":2240.0,"volume":0,"amount":0.0,"ret_1d":0.0,"gap":0.0,"range_pct":0.0,"ret_5":0.0,"ret_20":0.0,"ret_60":0.0,"ret_120":0.0,"ret_250":-74.6606,"ma20":2240.0,"ma60":2240.0,"ma120":2240.0,"ma200":2969.35,"close_vs_ma200":-24.5626,"close_vs_ma60":0.0,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":0.0,"r2_60":0.0,"slope_120":0.0,"r2_120":0.0,"slope_250":-81.8192,"r2_250":0.7566,"high52":10000.0,"low52":0.0,"pos_52w":22.4,"dd_52w":-77.6,"mdd_1y":-76.8509,"atr14_pct":57.1429,"vol_ann_60":0.0,"vol_avg20":0.0,"vol_ratio20":null,"vr5":null,"vr20":null,"amount_avg5":0.0,"amount_avg20":0.0,"amount_avg60":0.0,"obv_chg20":null,"turnover_20":0.0,"pv_eff_20":null,"rsi14":30.3226,"frgn_net_5":0.0,"inst_net_5":0.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":0.0,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0,"smart_net_5_pct":0.0,"frgn_net_20":0.0,"inst_net_20":0.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":0.0,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0,"smart_net_20_pct":0.0,"frgn_net_60":0.0,"inst_net_60":0.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":0.0,"inst_net_60_pct":0.0,"smart_net_60_pct":0.0,"frgn_net_120":0.0,"inst_net_120":0.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":0.0,"inst_net_120_pct":0.0,"smart_net_120_pct":0.0,"foreign_ratio":0.0,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":0.0,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":-5.0,"op_margin_q":-2.3041,"op_qoq":-145.4545,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":-600.0,"rev_yoy":21.9101,"op_trend_4q":5.7143,"fin_period":"202606","roe":-13.75,"debt_ratio":164.84,"per":null,"pbr":0.21,"div_yield":null,"foreign_rate":0.0,"target_price":null,"recomm":null,"nxt_close":null,"nxt_change_pct":null,"cns_per":null,"code":"145210","name":"다이나믹디자인","market":"KOSPI","sector_